{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/survival-analysis/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-survival-analysis","title":"什么是生存分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/survival-analysis/foundations/what-is-survival-analysis","wordCount":1341,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"censoring-truncation","title":"删失与截断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/survival-analysis/foundations/censoring-truncation","wordCount":1682,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"survival-hazard-functions","title":"生存与风险函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/survival-analysis/foundations/survival-hazard-functions","wordCount":1510,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础\">基础</h1><p>这一章不教任何具体算法，它教的是「语言」。后面非参数方法那一章里的 Kaplan-Meier 曲线、回归模型那一章里的 Cox 风险比、工程实践那一章里的竞争风险累积发生函数，全都在反复使用同一组概念：什么是事件、什么是删失、生存函数长什么样、风险函数和它是什么关系。如果这组词汇没立稳，后面的方法学起来会像在流沙上盖房子。</p>\n<p>三篇文档对应三块地基，边界划得很清楚，互不重叠。</p>\n<p>第一篇「什么是生存分析」回答最根本的定位问题：时间到事件数据长什么样，它和普通回归数据的差异在哪里，哪些现实问题属于这个范畴，以及这个领域为什么需要一套专门方法而不能套用现成工具。它给的是全局视角，不展开数学。</p>\n<p>第二篇「删失与截断」专攻让生存分析与众不同的那个特征——不完整观测。它把右删失、左删失、区间删失逐一讲清，再辨析常被混淆的截断（左截断、右截断）与删失的本质区别，并点明「删失独立性」这个几乎所有方法都默默依赖的关键假设。这两个概念只在这一篇深讲，其它篇遇到时一句话带过并链接回来。</p>\n<p>第三篇「生存与风险函数」给出整个领域的数学心脏：生存函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、风险函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、累积风险函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，以及它们之间相互推导的恒等式。这三个函数是后续所有估计量与模型的共同目标——Kaplan-Meier 估 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、Nelson-Aalen 估 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、Cox 模型建模 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。把这一篇的关系图记牢，后面就能在不同方法间自如切换视角。</p>\n<p>建议严格按顺序读这三篇：先知道这是什么、再知道数据的特殊性、最后掌握描述它的数学工具。读完这一章，你就拥有了读懂整个 hub 的全部前置知识。</p>\n"}